      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WANT SOME (6) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start sixth (17.21) at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. LILY MARLEEN (1) has missed the frame at her last couple but wasn't beaten far three back when second (17.48) at this track in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Can find the frame this time. SEA BREEZY (2) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 1.5 lengths fifth (17.44) over 300m at this track. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. MAGGIE STORM (7) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
